        67.21469116210938,
        527.1837768554688,
        81.83369445800781
      ],
      "text": "GDG considerations:  Regarding the evidence reviewed on the impact of decentralization on TB case",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 10.982335090637207,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        77.79670715332031,
        527.4221801757812,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "(109, 111) detection, the GDG observed that two trials   and one observational study of home-based",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        90.99671936035156,
        527.4085693359375,
        108.23371887207031
      ],
      "text": "(114) screening (without facility-based strengthening)   had fewer diagnoses or notifications among",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        106.99073028564453,
        527.4135131835938,
        121.43373107910156
      ],
      "text": "children aged below 15 years in the intervention group compared to the control group, but that",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        120.19074249267578,
        527.4442749023438,
        134.6337432861328
      ],
      "text": "none of these differences were statistically significant. The GDG discussed that while there may be a",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        133.3907012939453,
        527.4541625976562,
        147.8336944580078
      ],
      "text": "reduction in case notifications at higher levels of care, TB detection may improve if children are seen",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        146.59071350097656,
        527.3795166015625,
        161.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "by a competent clinician at the first point of access (such as at PHC level). The evidence overall was",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        159.7907257080078,
        527.1071166992188,
        174.2337188720703
      ],
      "text": "recognized as uncertain. The benefit of increased case finding and increased number of children with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.98884391784668,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        172.99073791503906,
        527.3783569335938,
        187.43373107910156
      ],
      "text": "TB who are initiated on TB treatment was considered to outweigh the concern for overtreatment.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        186.1907501220703,
        527.119873046875,
        200.6337432861328
      ],
      "text": "Therefore, undesirable effects for case detection were considered trivial. The GDG discussed potential",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.982486724853516,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        199.3907012939453,
        527.4300537109375,
        213.8336944580078
      ],
      "text": "risks of provision and management of TPT at the peripheral level, including undetected drug-related",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        212.59071350097656,
        527.4048461914062,
        227.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "adverse events such as hepatotoxicity and insufficient capacity to manage these. In addition, there",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        225.7906036376953,
        527.5170288085938,
        240.2335968017578
      ],
      "text": "may be a risk of TB disease being treated with a course of TPT rather than with a complete treatment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.999549865722656,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        238.99061584472656,
        527.4443359375,
        253.43360900878906
      ],
      "text": "regimen. All these undesirable events can potentially happen but were considered rare and not of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        252.1906280517578,
        527.5472412109375,
        266.6336364746094
      ],
      "text": "major concern. Therefore, undesirable effects for TPT provision were considered trivial as well. Overall,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.97081184387207,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        265.390625,
        527.4425659179688,
        279.8336486816406
      ],
      "text": "the GDG agreed that the balance of desirable and undesirable effects probably favours decentralized",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.986592292785645,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        278.590576171875,
        527.1520385742188,
        293.0335998535156
      ],
      "text": "TB services for case detection and provision of TPT to children and adolescents. The panel noted that",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.988393783569336,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        291.79058837890625,
        481.17059326171875,
        306.2336120605469
      ],
      "text": "differences in setting and availability of adequate resources are important considerations.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        313.49462890625,
        527.5642700195312,
        327.9376525878906
      ],
      "text": "The GDG discussed that family-centred, integrated care includes interventions at the household level",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.992447853088379,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        326.69451904296875,
        527.4112548828125,
        341.1375427246094
      ],
      "text": "to identify members of the household requiring evaluation for TB disease, TPT, treatment support,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        339.89459228515625,
        527.40478515625,
        354.3376159667969
      ],
      "text": "etc. Some overlap between integration of TB services into non-specialized settings such as general",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        353.0946044921875,
        527.4518432617188,
        367.5376281738281
      ],
      "text": "outpatient or primary care services, and decentralization was noted. For the evidence review, this",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        366.29449462890625,
        527.3970336914062,
        380.7375183105469
      ],
      "text": "was a slightly artificial separation, while in practice decentralization and integration into PHC may",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        379.4945983886719,
        527.4277954101562,
        393.9376220703125
      ],
      "text": "happen together. Overall, despite a lack of evidence on undesirable effects and low quality of the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        392.69451904296875,
        527.3883056640625,
        407.1375427246094
      ],
      "text": "data, the panel agreed that there is evidence of positive effects of family-centred integrated care. It",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        405.89459228515625,
        527.3826293945312,
        420.3376159667969
      ],
      "text": "was suggested that family-centred, integrated care could be an addition to the standard of care as",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        419.0946044921875,
        527.4453125,
        433.5376281738281
      ],
      "text": "well as to specialized services which do not have an integration component. Family-centred care in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        432.29449462890625,
        468.4881591796875,
        446.7375183105469
      ],
      "text": "the sense of family involvement was highlighted as a core principle of child health care.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        453.9985046386719,
        527.3806762695312,
        468.4415283203125
      ],
      "text": "The GDG discussed that setting specific factors related to TB burden or the organization of health",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        467.1985168457031,
        527.4223022460938,
        481.64154052734375
      ],
      "text": "services may impact feasibility, acceptability and equity considerations. They also discussed that the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        480.39849853515625,
        527.382568359375,
        494.8415222167969
      ],
      "text": "initial health system costs to establish decentralized and family-centred, integrated services may be",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        493.5985107421875,
        527.3363037109375,
        508.0415344238281
      ],
      "text": "relatively high (such as infrastructure, human resources, training, equipment, community engagement),",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.953601837158203,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        506.7984619140625,
        527.4535522460938,
        521.241455078125
      ],
      "text": "but that costs are likely to decrease over time, assuming that people with TB are effectively managed",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.999950408935547,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        519.99853515625,
        527.3858642578125,
        534.4415283203125
      ],
      "text": "and TPT is provided at the peripheral level, leading to a reduction in TB incidence. Decentralized",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        533.198486328125,
        527.3948364257812,
        547.6414794921875
      ],
      "text": "and family-centred, integrated services may result in important savings for affected families. Equity",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        546.3984985351562,
        527.4190063476562,
        560.8414916992188
      ],
      "text": "was considered an important cross-cutting issue impacting cost as well. The GDG highlighted that",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        559.5985107421875,
        527.4067993164062,
        574.04150390625
      ],
      "text": "TPT implementation can be very challenging with high levels of loss-to-follow-up in programmes",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        572.7984619140625,
        527.610595703125,
        587.241455078125
      ],
      "text": "implemented at higher levels of the health system, considering that children who are eligible for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        585.99853515625,
        527.4443359375,
        600.4415283203125
      ],
      "text": "TPT are not sick. The panel agreed that decentralization and integration of services can potentially",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        599.198486328125,
        527.5686645507812,
        613.6414794921875
      ],
      "text": "increase equity and enhance the success of the programme and judged that cost-effectiveness",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        612.3984985351562,
        527.41552734375,
        626.8414916992188
      ],
      "text": "probably favours decentralized and family-centred, integrated approaches to both case finding and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        625.5985107421875,
        148.58438110351562,
        640.04150390625
      ],
      "text": "provision of TPT.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        647.3023681640625,
        527.3817138671875,
        661.745361328125
      ],
      "text": "While the GDG stressed the importance of taking into consideration the potential impact of stigma",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        660.50244140625,
        527.4463500976562,
        674.9454345703125
      ],
      "text": "when decentralizing TB services for children and adolescents to lower levels, the panel judged",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        673.702392578125,
        527.41455078125,
        688.1453857421875
      ],
      "text": "that decentralized approaches are probably acceptable to key stakeholders. Overall decentralized",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        686.9025268554688,
        527.4157104492188,
        701.3455200195312
      ],
      "text": "and family-centred, integrated approaches were judged feasible to implement, although feasibility",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        700.1024169921875,
        527.4487915039062,
        714.54541015625
      ],
      "text": "may vary depending on infrastructure, available funding and the structure of the NTP, among",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        713.3024291992188,
        527.446533203125,
        727.7454223632812
      ],
      "text": "others. However, adequate investment is critical to enable the acceptability, equity and feasibility of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        726.5023803710938,
        191.38331604003906,
        740.9453735351562
      ],
      "text": "decentralized approaches.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.23320007324219,
        801.0170288085938,
        136.43409729003906,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "60 WHO consolidated",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.43649291992188,
        801.0170288085938,
        170.0604705810547,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        170.06539916992188,
        801.0170288085938,
        450.3536071777344,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "on tuberculosis, Module 5: Management of tuberculosis in children and adolescents",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
